  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia: Enhancing the Indonesia Public Prosecution Service (PPS) by Supporting the Institutional Reforms of the Attorney General&apos;s Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: Staff at the AGO, Provincial and District Prosecutor Office.Indirect beneficiaries: Indonesian justice seekers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aimed to enhance effectiveness, accountability and transparency of the Indonesian Public Prosecution Service (PPS).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Attorney General&#x2019;s Office (AGO) to implement its institutional reform initiatives, by 1) increasing the AGO efforts to improve its IT-based Case Management System (CMS) and processes; and 2) strengthening the capacity of AGO officials and local offices in handling performance-based budgeting.</narrative>
  </description>
